questions.promptEn:
You recently ordered a pair of wireless headphones from an online shop. When the package arrived, the headphones were damaged and the charging cable was missing.

Write an email to the shop's customer service department. In your email:
- say when you ordered the headphones and give your order details;
- describe the two problems;
- explain what action you want the shop to take.

Write 120-150 words. Begin your email with 'Dear Sir or Madam'.
